  "figure_scope": "Qualitative thesis figures. Positive-label training rows define the EDGRec/LightGCN propagation graph. The NetworkX topology uses the same displayed train-row budget per dataset, prioritizes a degree-aware label-positive propagation core, and uses the remaining rows for non-positive sign diagnostics when available. Positive-sign rows are counted in the metadata but are not drawn as a separate overlay because that would usually duplicate the label-positive propagation rows. UMAP panels are sampled projections and must not be used as ranking-performance evidence."
